## In-Flight Experience
- **Seating**: Standard economy class seating. Seat selection is available for a fee.
- **Food and Beverage**: Pegasus Cafe offers a buy-on-board menu with snacks, meals, and drinks. Pre-ordering meals online is available at a discount.
- **Wi-Fi**: Not available.
- **Entertainment**: No seat-back screens. Passengers are advised to bring their own devices.

