## BolBol Loyalty Program
- **1,000 BolPoints on First Flight**: Members earn 1,000 BolPoints upon completing their first flight.
- **Earning Rate**: Earn 1 BolPoint for every 2 TL spent via Pegasus channels (website or app).
- **Redemption**: Use 2,000+ BolPoints to partially pay for flight tickets.

