## Sustainability
- **Governance**: Operates under a corporate Sustainability Policy (Dec 2020) overseen by a dedicated Sustainability Office reporting to the CEO and Board. ([flypgs.com](https://www.flypgs.com/en/sustainability/about-pegasus-airlines-and-our-sustainability-framework))
- **2030 Target**: Achieve a **20% reduction in CO₂ emissions per RPK** by 2030 (vs. 2019). ([flypgs.com](https://www.flypgs.com/en/sustainability))
- **2050 Target**: Attain **net-zero carbon emissions** by 2050. ([press release](https://www.flypgs.com/en/press-room/press-releases/pegasus-airlines-commits-to-achieve-net-zero-carbon-emissions-by-2050))
- **Fleet Efficiency**: By end-2023, ~80% of the fleet consisted of Airbus A320neo/A321neo, achieving up to **20% fuel efficiency gains**.

## Campaigns and Offers
- **Flash Sales**: Campaigns with ultra-low fares (e.g., €1 + taxes) on select routes for BolBol members.
- **Bonus BolPoints**: Promotions granting extra points for specific routes or booking periods.
- **Partner Discounts**: Offers such as "70% off for the second BolBol member".
- **App-Exclusive Offers**: Early access and special pricing available only on the mobile app.

## Operational Information

### Customer Services at the Airport
- **Check-in Counter Closing Time**: Closes **45 minutes** before departure for domestic flights and **60 minutes** for international flights.
- **Recommended Airport Arrival**: At least **2 hours** before departure.
- **Self-Service Kiosks**: Available for quick check-in without baggage.
- **Mobile Boarding Pass**: Use a mobile barcode for boarding.

### Check‑in Policies
- **Online Check‑in Window**: Opens **7 days** before departure and closes **60 minutes** before take-off. ([flypgs.com – Check-in](https://www.flypgs.com/en/useful-info/info-about-flights/check-in))
- **Required Documents**: A valid photo ID (passport and national ID for international/Cyprus flights) is mandatory. A driver's license is not accepted for international travel.

### Baggage and Services
- **Light Package**: Includes one under-seat bag (max 3 kg).
- **Saver/Comfort Packages**: Include under-seat bag, cabin baggage, and a 20 kg checked baggage allowance.
- **Additional Services**: Extra baggage or meals can be purchased online. ([flypgs.com – Baggage Allowance](https://www.flypgs.com/en/pegasus-baggage-allowance))

### Contact and Support
- **Website**: www.flypgs.com
- **Online Support Form**: [Write to Us](https://www.flypgs.com/en/help-center)
- **Call Center**: 24/7 multilingual support. Türkiye general line: **0888 228 12 12**.
- **Ticket Management**: Changes or cancellations for bookings made via official channels can be managed online with a PNR and surname, subject to fare rules.
